    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Lust Sisters</strong> \ud83d\udd1e is a 3D adult visual novel with point-and-click exploration and light puzzle elements. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3718530/extras/f80f141456574ca59894d1f1af72b94b.poster.avif?t=1755537081\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3718530/extras/f80f141456574ca59894d1f1af72b94b.webm?t=1755537081\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3718530/extras/f80f141456574ca59894d1f1af72b94b.mp4?t=1755537081\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>After a chance encounter with a nun on a rainy road, you find yourself stuck overnight in a secluded monastery. What starts off innocent quickly turns seductive \u2014 and strangely controlled.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3718530/extras/fd80ed0a3509246afeda774d049e1d6e.poster.avif?t=1755537081\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3718530/extras/fd80ed0a3509246afeda774d049e1d6e.webm?t=1755537081\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3718530/extras/fd80ed0a3509246afeda774d049e1d6e.mp4?t=1755537081\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>While searching for tools to fix your car, you\u2019re asked to help around the monastery\u2026 but each favor pulls you deeper into the sisters\u2019 sensual routines. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3718530/extras/0170ff74085aa508358b0ddea62fae9f.avif?t=1755537081\" width=595 height=148 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The line between hospitality and obsession starts to blur. Is this just a bizarre stop on your journey \u2014 or something you\u2019ll never escape?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3718530/extras/90d541c7b9967b05883dad815a06deec.poster.avif?t=1755537081\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3718530/extras/90d541c7b9967b05883dad815a06deec.webm?t=1755537081\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3718530/extras/90d541c7b9967b05883dad815a06deec.mp4?t=1755537081\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3718530/extras/00adf125cd9ac00c144f620a8cb567b0.avif?t=1755537081\" width=595 height=219 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd27 <strong>Repair &amp; Escape</strong> \u2013 Find tools and parts to fix your car and plan your way out.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc9e <strong>Relationship System</strong> \u2013 Your connection with each nun affects how much they\u2019re willing to help\u2026 and it may decide your ending.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udde9 <strong>Puzzle &amp; Explore</strong> \u2013 Solve tasks, explore the monastery, and unlock new scenes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u26ea <strong>Church Secrets</strong> \u2013 Uncover the hidden rituals and twisted rules behind the sisters\u2019 way of life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd1e <strong>Adult Content</strong> \u2013 Enjoy spicy scenes that change depending on how you play.</p>",
